<title>USA: KDB issues $300 mln CPI-linked Yankees - JP Morgan.</title>
<headline>KDB issues $300 mln CPI-linked Yankees - JP Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Yankee debt issue from Korea Development Bank was priced on Monday, according to sole manager J.P. Morgan Securities Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER KOREA DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	  COUPON CPI+3.4 PCT MATURITY 3/01/2002</p>
<p>TYPE CPI-LINK NOTES ISS PRICE 100.00   FIRST PAY DATE 9/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A1     YIELD CPI+3.4 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS			    CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1672</p>
</text>
